<content><![CDATA[<p>Videos from the campaign that don't have a poster of their own. They live on the GitHub release, not in git.</p>
<h2>Pillar stages</h2>
<p>An 8-bit stage select, a power card, a live demo recorded on the real haxtheweb.org, and a stage-clear card, 42 seconds each. Every stage also comes as four separate segment files on the release.</p>
<ul><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_stage_accessible_full.mp4">Accessible</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_stage_efficient_full.mp4">Efficient</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_stage_extensible_full.mp4">Extensible</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_stage_open_full.mp4">Free and Open</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_stage_agnostic_full.mp4">Platform Agnostic</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_stage_remixable_full.mp4">Remixable</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_stage_sustainable_full.mp4">Sustainable</a></li></ul>
<h2>Stories</h2>
<ul><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_story_generic.mp4">Three students find HAX Lab, learn by doing and ride into the future (fictional)</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_story_real.mp4">Jimmy Kane, Winston White and Zach Dodson: from HAX Lab to Ford, IBM and Penn State</a></li></ul>
