<ul><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_logo_sting.mp4">Rolling H cube logo sting</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_intro_gameboy.mp4">Start-up intro: Game Boy</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_intro_gba.mp4">Start-up intro: Game Boy Advance</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_intro_playstation.mp4">Start-up intro: PlayStation</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_intro_wii.mp4">Start-up intro: Wii</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/haxtheweb/art/releases/download/media-2026-11/hax_intro_hacker.mp4">Start-up intro: Hacker (ASCII)</a></li></ul>
<p><em>The console intros are homages to well-known start-up screens: review them before official promotion.</em></p>]]></content>
